    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631130/extras/d27fc05039b549f16814032f6055cb57.poster.avif?t=1752747642\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631130/extras/d27fc05039b549f16814032f6055cb57.webm?t=1752747642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631130/extras/d27fc05039b549f16814032f6055cb57.mp4?t=1752747642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like games with insane graphics and no game? Well you came to the wrong place, but I can give you a rifle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Shooter </strong>offers potato graphics to run on your potato PC while still bringing movement and skill based gun slinging to the table. Have a blast getting wrecked by enemies and collecting weapons along your journey to mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631130/extras/1eef570a5a629bb44e5a52c164a94fd1.poster.avif?t=1752747642\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631130/extras/1eef570a5a629bb44e5a52c164a94fd1.webm?t=1752747642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631130/extras/1eef570a5a629bb44e5a52c164a94fd1.mp4?t=1752747642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom controls\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim trainer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
